- Vulnerability to fire: Fiery attacks are enhanced
- Critical Damage: Constriction. Target takes d4 STR damage per round as the tentacles squeeze them.

### Area 30: Blood KIng’s Studio (page 41)

#### 12 Finished Pieces: Feeding a painting blood

- “1d4hp” becomes “1 STR.”

