#### Porcelain Dolls: Valuable but fragile

- 23 dolls total. 2 are bulky. 3 take up a slot each. 12 can be carried in bundles of 3. 6 are petty. A collector will only pay 5,000 for the whole set. Otherwise it’s 100 coins a doll, or 1,000 for a partly broken set.

### Area 34: Observatorium (pages 44-45)

#### Planetary System Model: Taking out a planet from their orbit

