### Area 36: Dungeon Cells (Page 46)

#### What is found? Table

- Result 2 becomes “2 scrolls: Magic Dampener and Ward”

### Area 37: Torture Room (page 47)

#### Lord Daemetrius (Void Fungi)

- 9 HP, 12 STR, 7 DEX, 15 WIL, fungal pseudopods (d6 blast)
- Critical damage: Fungal infection. The target’s skin sprouts a patch of Void Fungi in 1d6 turns. They suffer d6 WIS damage per day. When reduced to 0 WIS, they are under the Void Fungi’s control. In the meantime, they can communicate with the hive mind (and can experience, as if they were there, any area occupied by Void Fungi).
- Cloud of Spores: Upon taking critical damage, Lord Daemetrius (Void Fungi)’s head bursts in a cloud of spores. Everyone in the room must save STR or become infected with Void Fungi.
